whether or not you've already finished  blood-borne and are starting on your new  game+ playthrough there's a good chance  some of the game's more obscure  mechanics may have passed you by here  are seven of the best that should help  you master blood-borne number one you  can attack while climbing a ladder press  r1 to punch upward or r2 to kick  downward just don't run out of stamina  while you're on the ladder or you'll  fall to your death  number two your trick weapon  transformation is also an attack if  you're in the middle of attacking an  enemy you can press l1 to perform an  attack that also transforms your weapon  into its other mode at the same time  stylish number three you can restore the  health lost from creating blood bullets  if you press up on the d-pad to create  blood bullets the regain system  activates and you can restore that  health cost by attacking the nearest  enemy it's basically free ammo number  four you can add gestures to your notes  when writing a note press r1 a couple of  times to find more options you can add a  second set of words and a gesture this  is great for the point gesture as it  saves the direction you're looking in  when you start writing the note as such  it's possible to literally point out  secrets  number five you can break out of  gravattack's if you quickly alternate  pressing l2 and r2 you can break out of  a grab slightly quicker you'll also  break out of it without getting knocked  down and can immediately run away or  start attacking number six you can  reassign the controls the ps4 is latest  update allows you to reassign controls  through the accessibility option under  settings  I recommend moving the circle button  over to l1 that way you can sprint and  dodge while retaining full camera  control on the right stick which is  great when fighting blood bonds larger  bosses and finally tip number seven you  can regain help from dying enemies if  you've just killed an enemy and the  regain system is still active hitting an  enemy during their death animation will  still siphon health out of them so go  ahead match that attack button for all  its work
 

